<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH FUND RIF '96 AUDITED NET CZK 2.3BLN.</title>
<headline>CZECH FUND RIF '96 AUDITED NET CZK 2.3BLN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech investment fund Restitucni a Investicni Fond a.s. (RIF) said on Thursday its 1996 audited net profit reached 2.55 billion crowns, after a 4.95 billion crown loss in 1995.</p>
</text>
